      <li>Click the <strong>Details</strong> tab to view the IP address.</li>
      </ol>
      <h2 id="virt-viewing-vmi-ip-cli_virt-configuring-viewing-ips-for-vms" class="group scroll-mt-20">Viewing the IP address of a virtual machine by using the CLI<a href="#virt-viewing-vmi-ip-cli_virt-configuring-viewing-ips-for-vms" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
